Description: Calculates tumor-microenvironment and tumor-cell expression signature scores from a bulk gene-expression matrix. Provides published gene sets and scoring methods for immune activity, hypoxia, an OCR-score of mitochondrial oxygen demand, and small-cell neuroendocrine phenotype.
